# HTTP contracts

- Routes live under `/v1`.
- Update `contracts/openapi/v1.yaml` in the same change as the handler.
- Every response field is named in the contract. `additionalProperties` is false unless an ADR says otherwise.
- A contract test loads the OpenAPI document and asserts the handler payload matches it.
- The Go API is not on the path of a device-to-provider model call.
